{"case_id": "singapore_male_19930408_P004-Q19", "domain": "relationship", "question": "命主感情状况为何？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主为己土，生于辰月，土旺得令，且月干、时干双透丙火正印生身，日支未土为比肩帮身，整体身强。感情方面看财星（水）与官星（木）。年柱癸酉，癸水为偏财（男命偏财代表情人或短暂恋情），坐酉金食神，食神生财，但酉金与日支未土半合，暗示感情易有变动。月柱丙辰，丙火正印透出，辰土为劫财，劫财旺而克财，且辰酉合，财星被合动，主感情竞争或短暂。时柱丙子，子水为偏财，与日支未土相害，子未害主感情内部矛盾，且子水被丙火盖头，财星受制。\n\n综合来看，命主财星（妻星）多现但皆受制或逢合害，且劫财旺，主感情不稳定、多短暂恋情，且目前无正官（夫星）引动婚姻，故未婚。时柱子水偏财与日支未土相害，暗示当前若有恋情也易生矛盾，但未到离婚程度。因此最符合“未婚，单身，恋情多短暂”的描述。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "singapore_male_19930408_P004-Q19", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_1_g2\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4180, "response_id": "34fce011-6701-45bc-bb67-d12d9719efa3", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 227, "completion_tokens": 292, "total_tokens": 519, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 99}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
